<% const type=page.section; const assignments=type==='assignments'; const announcements=type==='announcements'; const data=learning(); %>
<div class="page-wrap" id="classroom" data-type="<%= type %>">
<div class="eyebrow"><%= assignments?'COURSE ASSIGNMENTS':announcements?'COURSE BULLETIN':'TECHNICAL DISCUSSION' %></div>
<div class="page-heading workspace-heading"><div><h1><%= assignments?'课程作业与提交记录':announcements?'课程公告':'技术提问与答疑' %></h1><p><%= assignments?'查看教师发布的任务要求，提交算例、运行日志与结果分析。':announcements?'查看课程安排、资料更新与作业通知。':'提交可复现的问题，讨论模型设置、数值方法与计算结果。' %></p></div><% if(!announcements){ %><a class="button" href="<%= announcements?'#teacher-tools':'#compose' %>"><%= assignments?'提交作业':announcements?'发布公告':'发起提问' %> <%- icon('arrow') %></a><% } %></div>
<div class="classroom-note"><%- icon('github') %><p>使用 GitHub 账号参与。发布、提交与回复会在 GitHub 上确认，内容公开可见；请勿填写密码、学号等个人敏感信息。</p><a href="https://github.com/quantlabshark/quantlabshark.github.io/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">在 GitHub 查看 ↗</a></div>
<div class="workspace-tools"><div class="filter-tabs" role="group" aria-label="内容筛选"><% (assignments?['已发布作业','提交记录']:announcements?['课程公告']:['全部问题','待解决','已解决']).forEach((t,i)=>{ %><button data-issue-filter="<%= i %>" class="<%= i===0?'selected':'' %>" aria-pressed="<%= i===0 %>"><%= t %></button><% }); %></div><button class="text-link icon-button-text" id="refresh-issues">刷新内容 ↻</button></div><p class="live-status" id="live-status" aria-live="polite">正在连接 GitHub，读取公开记录…</p><div class="issue-list" id="issue-list"></div><button class="button secondary" id="load-more" hidden>加载更多记录</button>
<% if(!announcements){ %><section class="composer" id="compose"><h2><%= assignments?'提交你的作业':'提出一个可复现的问题' %></h2><p class="muted">填写后进入 GitHub 确认发布。可在 GitHub 编辑区拖入图片、PDF 或算例压缩包。</p><form id="student-form" data-kind="<%= assignments?'submission':'question' %>"><div class="form-grid"><label class="form-field"><span>关联课程</span><select name="lesson"><option value="">通用 / 暂不关联</option><% data.lessons.forEach(l=>{ %><option value="<%= String(l.id).padStart(2,'0') %>">第 <%= String(l.id).padStart(2,'0') %> 讲 · <%= l.title %></option><% }); %></select></label><label class="form-field"><span><%= assignments?'作业 Issue 编号（必填）':'问题标题（必填）' %></span><input name="subject" <%- assignments?'type="number" min="1" step="1" placeholder="例如：12（教师发布的作业编号）"':'type="text" maxlength="90" placeholder="例如：checkMesh 出现负体积单元"' %> required></label></div><label class="form-field"><span><%= assignments?'完成情况与分析':'问题描述与已尝试的方法' %></span><textarea name="body" required maxlength="4000" placeholder="<%= assignments?'简述修改的参数、结果和判断依据。日志与算例附件可在下一步添加。':'描述预期结果、实际现象、出错命令、关键日志，以及已经尝试过的排查步骤。' %>"></textarea><small>OpenFOAM 版本固定为 v2512；代码、文件名和完整错误信息有助于复现。</small></label><div class="composer-actions"><button class="button" type="submit">前往 GitHub 确认<%= assignments?'提交':'提问' %> ↗</button><p>此处不会直接发布。下一步在 GitHub 点击 Submit new issue。</p></div><p class="form-error error" role="alert"></p></form></section><% } %>
<p class="github-destination">公开记录保存在 foamlabshark/quantlabshark.github.io 仓库。登录后可在个人中心同步学习进度。</p>
</div><script src="/assets/classroom.js" defer></script>
